{"message":"Since you have maintained Rho-Bank checking status for about four months, you meet the 90-day referrer requirement. Your World Blue Account makes you eligible for the **$300 World Blue referral bonus**, provided her LLC qualifies as an international business and deposits at least $25,000 within 90 days. Her planned $31,000 funding would satisfy that deposit threshold.

Because the business is described only as a tech consulting LLC, do not assume it qualifies as international. Confirm that it will conduct international operations, such as holding or transacting in supported foreign currencies or serving counterparties in supported regions. If it does not, the safer qualifying alternative is the **Lime Green referral**, which pays $200 for a $15,000 deposit within 90 days.

Your Cobalt Blue Account does not change the World Blue bonus amount. Send the referral before she applies, use only one referral code, and ensure she has consented to receive the invitation. The business must be new to Rho-Bank, have a different primary owner from any existing Rho-Bank business account, and not be registered at your address. Referral bonuses cannot be combined with another new-account promotion."}
